# The archive corpora (~27MB of GIF/PNG). Source material, not build input:
# `bun run db:import-corpus` decodes them locally and stores the result in the
# database, so nothing at deploy time ever reads them. Keep them out of git
# history — committing them is easy and undoing it is not.
archive-corpus-rtp/
archive-corpus-sic/
archive-samples/
.env*
